{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他突然发现自己很想靠近一个人，心里发热，连自己都有些意外。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"心动、发热、意外、克制\",\n      \"missed\": \"他为什么不敢表达：怕对方发现自己太需要这份亲近，会觉得有负担；所以只敢透露一点喜欢。第三句里亲近带来的甜，以及对下次能否更坦白的犹豫，也需要逐句读。第一组意象短语不容易直接对应到他的处境。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他突然意识到自己很想靠近对方，但这份心动让他有些意外。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"心动、发热、意外、忐忑\",\n      \"missed\": \"怕自己的需要给对方造成负担，因此不敢充分表达喜欢；一点亲近已经让他觉得甜，却还不确定下次能否更坦白。中间的原因和最后的心理变化都需要读完整句子。下方音符动画较密，但文字仍然更醒目。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他发现自己越来越想靠近对方，却还不太敢把这份喜欢坦白说出来。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"心动、甜蜜、犹豫、谨慎\",\n      \"missed\": \"他害怕对方觉得自己需要太多，所以刻意控制表达；以及他已经从一点亲近中尝到甜头，却不知道下一次能不能更坦白。这两层心理需要读第二、第三段才能完整抓到。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"三条大字号长句视觉权重相近，第一条、第二条、第三条分别承载心动、克制的原因、亲近后的甜蜜与犹豫，一眼能抓到心动，却不容易同时抓到完整的心理过程。第一条下面又有六个偏意象的短语，容易形成另一组需要单独解读的信息。整体逻辑其实连贯：想靠近、怕成为负担、只敢透露一点喜欢、尝到甜头却仍不敢坦白；主要问题是这些关系需要读完几块文字才能充分串起来。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "5fd108dc-fe7f-4dee-aef5-f101f5089d4e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261109T223557927041Z", "elapsed_seconds": 210.344, "completed_utc": "2026-11-09T22:39:28.291615+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "7296157f576a87230a29e4a29647eea927ea0e45ed845bebb2f45b2895faab40", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261109T223557927041Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "a6b7d6dd4258924fa0f507c2524dfca968b5a185d80d5909b29d5befcc1073e3"}}}
